# Nori, Teller of Tales: "Whenever Nori attacks, target attacking creature gains first strike until end of turn." Nori and a
# Savannah Lions (2/1) attack on turn 3 into Bot2's Grizzly Bears (2/2) and Nori's trigger targets the Lions - a creature that is
# not attacking (Bot2's Bears) is no legal target. The Lions strike first, kill the blocking Bears and survive; first strike
# is gone on turn 4, and Nori herself (a 2/2) never had it.

